# .gitignore — Linux Ubuntu Wiki
# Rule of thumb: if it's personal, generated, or secret, it doesn't belong in git.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obsidian: allow-list. Only the SHARED settings are committed; everything else
# in .obsidian/ is personal and would cause `git pull` conflicts for readers.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.obsidian/*
# app.json = link format (relative paths, no [[wikilinks]])
# templates.json = templates folder is _templates/
# core-plugins.json = which core plugins are on by default
!.obsidian/app.json
!.obsidian/templates.json
!.obsidian/core-plugins.json
# Everything else stays local, including:
#   workspace.json, workspace-mobile.json   open tabs and pane layout
#   community-plugins.json, plugins/         personal plugin choices (see CONTRIBUTING)
#   appearance.json, themes/, snippets/      looks
#   hotkeys.json, graph.json, bookmarks.json personal preferences

# Obsidian trash (when "move deleted files to .trash" is on)
.trash/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Wiki conventions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reader scratch space: never synced, so it can't conflict or be overwritten.
# The empty .gitkeep is committed so the folder exists after cloning.
_personal/*
!_personal/.gitkeep

# Local-only working notes, e.g. ROADMAP-kali.LOCAL.md, NEXT-STEPS.LOCAL.md
*.LOCAL.md

# Pandoc exports: generated output, rebuild from the .md instead
# (see _maintainers/export-to-docx-pdf.md)
*.docx
*.pdf
custom-reference.docx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets safety net: rule 6 says no secrets ever; this catches accidents.
# It does NOT replace reading `git diff` before you commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.kdbx
known_hosts

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
